StellarChain (stellarchain)
------------
The original 842 mainnet records were combined from these two public files:

https://github.com/stellarchain/v4-api/blob/064ccd2e5c49d4b5188ecf3cd421256d5d72b7f6/resources/known_accounts.csv
https://github.com/stellarchain/v4-api/blob/064ccd2e5c49d4b5188ecf3cd421256d5d72b7f6/resources/known_accounts_with_balance_and_transactions.csv

Verification flags for matching mainnet account labels come from this public snapshot.

https://github.com/stellarchain/v4-api/blob/b3fa2a85529b47d8f6765270724650f4ef6cb7d3/resources/known_accounts.csv

Public Stellar ledger (stellar-ledger)
-------------------------------------
Address-only entries were confirmed against the public account endpoint.

https://pubnet.stellarchain.io/accounts

Stellar documentation (stellar)
-------------------------------
Native XLM is documented in the Stellar asset reference. The Stellar Development Foundation published the Burn Account address.

https://developers.stellar.org/docs/learn/fundamentals/stellar-data-structures/assets
https://stellar.org/blog/foundation-news/sdfs-next-steps

Circle (circle)
---------------
Circle publishes its USDC and EURC issuer identifiers and CCTP contract addresses.

https://developers.circle.com/stablecoins/usdc-contract-addresses
https://developers.circle.com/stablecoins/eurc-contract-addresses
https://developers.circle.com/cctp/references/stellar-contracts

